    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore Central Asia and liberate your homeland from invaders. Feel like a true Turkish warrior. Experience flawless archery and swordsmanship. In this graphically ambitious game, you\u2019ll feel as if you\u2019re truly there.</strong></i><br><i><strong> </strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><i><strong>Erlik Han has declared war on the earth, and if he gets what he wants, it could mean the end of the world. Villages are being burned and destroyed one by one. Evil is slowly engulfing the entire realm.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udca0Survival Mechanic\ud83d\udca0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udd35You\u2019ll need to gather resources and set up camp to survive, with highly realistic survival dynamics.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udd35Hunt to satisfy your hunger.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udd35Build a camp to rest, but will the campsite be as safe as it seems?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u269c\ufe0fUnique Magical Power\u269c\ufe0f</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe1Each boss has unique powers you can claim!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe1Solve mysteries to unlock unique spells inspired by mythology.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udd30Breathtaking Stor\ud83d\udd30</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe2While rooted entirely in Turkish mythology, the story includes fictional elements.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe2The realistic narrative structure is largely drawn from books about Central Asian Turks.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf0dOpen World and Beyon\ud83c\udf0d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe3The open world is filled with mysteries and locations inspired by Turkish mythology.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe3Unique region designs: each boss area is crafted to immerse you in its world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe3Mongol outposts, taking advantage of the disaster to plunder the land, can be destroyed.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i><br><i><strong>You might be the only hope!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>and more...</strong></i><br><strong><i>Gameplay video: July 12, 2025</i></strong></p>",
