aph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf0dOpen World and Beyon\ud83c\udf0d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe3The open world is filled with mysteries and locations inspired by Turkish mythology.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe3Unique region designs: each boss area is crafted to immerse you in its world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udfe3Mongol outposts, taking advantage of the disaster to plunder the land, can be destroyed.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i><br><i><strong>You might be the only hope!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>and more...</strong></i><br><strong><i>Gameplay video: July 12, 2025</i></strong></p>",
